data: {"event": "done", "session_id": "b6e5a4b5-574a-4fe3-a52d-dcec7e656178", "request_id": "7f8de59f-4146-4e6b-8853-aa45740b91f4", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "content": "The search for \"TEST COPY\" returned 7 datasets:\n\n1. `xx099900`: [TEST COPY] Multisensory Gamma Entrainment (EEG, 1 subject)\n2. `xx099901`: [TEST COPY] MEG-BIDS Brainstorm data sample (MEG, 2 subjects)\n3. `xx099902`: [TEST COPY] OWM-Dataset (iEEG, 13 subjects)\n4. `xx099903`: [TEST COPY] MUniverse Caillet et al 2023 (EMG, 6 subjects)\n5. `xx099904`: [TEST COPY] BNCI 2015-003 P300 dataset (EEG, 10 subjects)\n6. `xx099905`: [TEST COPY] BNCI 2014-004 Motor Imagery dataset (EEG, 1 subject)\n7. `xx099906`: [TEST COPY] Electrophysiological markers of surprise-induced failures of visual and auditory awareness (EEG and behavior, 33 subjects)\n\nAll seven ids use the `xx` prefix and the `10.5072` test DOI namespace, so they look like test copies rather than production datasets. The `xx099900` entry has no Zarr copy.", "citations": [], "usage": {"input_tokens": 28582, "output_tokens": 570, "cache_read_tokens": 27439, "cache_creation_tokens": 1137, "estimated_cost": 0.000702, "partial": false}, "mode": "quick"}

